// STAGE 4: MILKY, SEMI-OPAQUE WHITE GLAZES (THE WAXED PAPER VEIL)
// =============================================================================
function drawMilkyWaxPaperGlazes() {
  resetBrush();

  // Leading fold vertices (where the waxed paper hood ends on the left and the sandwich escapes)
